      "contentHtml": "<p></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnamoi/bunkeireibun/100001010112.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> １．</p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai34_bk_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><span><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></span><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>先生<rp>(</rp><rt>せんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>言<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った とおりに、<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きます。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Viết theo giáo viên đọc.</div></div></div><p></p> <p> ２．</p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai34_bk_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>ごはんを <ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べた あとで、<ruby>歯<rp>(</rp><rt>は</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>磨<rp>(</rp><rt>みが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きます。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Sau khi ăn cơm xong tôi đáng răng.</div></div></div><p></p> <p> ３．</p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai34_bk_3.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>コーヒーは <ruby>砂糖<rp>(</rp><rt>さとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れないで <ruby>飲<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みます。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Tôi uống cafe nhưng không cho đường vào.</div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p></div>",
